               LAPTOP (MySQL)
                     │
                     │
             User clicks Sync
                     │
                     ▼
        1. Ask Website for Status
                     │
                     ▼
          WEBSITE (SQLite)
                     │
        returns last_node_id
        returns last_change_log_id
                     │
                     ▼
      2. Upload New Nodes (Chunked)
                     │
        500 rows each request
                     │
                     ▼
          Website inserts them
                     │
      continue until <500 rows
                     │
                     ▼
    3. Upload Change Logs (Chunked)
                     │
        500 logs each request
                     │
                     ▼
      Website applies operations
                     │
      continue until <500 logs
                     │
                     ▼
            Sync Complete
























            User clicks Sync in App
                     │
                     ▼
1. App sends its sync status
   - last_node_id
   - last_change_log_id
                     │
                     ▼
2. Laptop uploads New Nodes (Chunked)
                     │
          500 rows per request
                     │
                     ▼
          App inserts them
                     │
      Continue until <500 rows
                     │
                     ▼
3. Laptop uploads Change Logs (Chunked)
                     │
          500 logs per request
                     │
                     ▼
      App applies operations
        - DELETE
        - REPLACE
                     │
      Continue until <500 logs
                     │
                     ▼
             Sync Complete
